# Demonstrates the complete ANI RC5 feature set:
#   AMOLED Modern Theme + Live Accent Colors + Material 3 You Icons + Top Status Bar,
#   1-Tap Live Appearance Hub, Interactive slider(...) Control, 7 OFL Fonts,
